@host = http://localhost:5344

### Single specialist
POST {{host}}/agents/architecture/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "ArchitectureAgent",
  "messages": [
    { "role": "user", "content": "Migrate our monolith to microservices on AKS with Azure Service Bus and a PostgreSQL database per service." }
  ]
}

### Full review board (4 specialists -> synthesis)
POST {{host}}/agents/review-board/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "ArchitectureReviewBoard",
  "messages": [
    { "role": "user", "content": "Migrate our monolith to microservices on AKS with Azure Service Bus and a PostgreSQL database per service." }
  ]
}
